article en "Identity-only Doc PageSet profile"
body
  cons paragraph
    cons sentence
      cons code "pages::compact::resolve"
      cons text " selects PageIdentityProfile::CompactV1."
      nil
    cons " It requires the optional FoundationGroupCommitmentCodec rather than producing archive transport."
    cons " LegacyV1 and ArchiveV1 retain their existing preimages, domains and adapters."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "A private document preimage is exactly a two-element NDF List containing:"
    nil
  cons list ordered 1
    cons item none body cons paragraph
      cons "The structurally checked Doc DocumentSyntax skeleton whose typed embed group is empty; all other fields, embed kinds/references, sources, origins, views and mappings are unchanged."
      nil nil
    cons item none body cons paragraph
      cons "Bytes32 of the complete Foundation group commitment from spec32."
      nil nil
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "The original native Doc and maximum consuming occurrence depth of every guest are validated first."
    cons " A provider's component count must match the native group."
    cons " The retained native proof stays operation-local; the skeleton is not standalone native Doc syntax."
    cons " No fabricated schema record or transport decode API is used."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "A private PageSet preimage is a two-element List containing the ordered page list and checked PageFiles."
    cons " Each page is a two-element List of checked PageRegistration and the private document preimage."
    cons " Files bind registrations and exact content bytes."
    cons " These lists are internal hash preimages only, not portable PageSet/archive values."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons sentence
      cons text "Domains are "
      cons code "NEPL3.Doc.Compact.Pages.v1\\0"
      cons text ", "
      cons code "NEPL3.Doc.Compact.Document.v1\\0"
      cons text ", and "
      cons code "NEPL3.Doc.Compact.Guest.v1\\0"
      cons text "; the last wraps the existing v2 entry commitments."
      nil
    cons sentence
      cons text " The explicit plan adapters recompute this profile and compare canonical plan data under "
      cons code "NEPL3.Doc.Compact.PagePlan.v1\\0"
      cons text "."
      nil
    cons " Cross-profile plans reject."
    cons " CheckedPages exposes the selected profile; native structures/text helpers retain original limits, outer-depth and borrowed-document scope."
    cons " Registration and link-resolution ordering remain shared with existing resolvers."
    cons " Stops retain their sticky reason."
    nil
  cons paragraph
    cons "All native/schema validation, source admission, preimage construction and hashing use the same cumulative Budget."
    cons " No serialized archive bytes are produced, and no output limit is reset or increased."
    cons " This profile alone does not select a tools renderer or prove historical-corpus generation succeeds."
    nil
  nil
